ac3.library and ac3fpu.library: changes
=======================================

1.1 (14 November 2026)
----------------------

- ac3fpu.library: samples rounded to 16 bits without changing the FPU's
  rounding mode (FPCR) and back for every sample.
- The Version() text says 1.1 too.

1.0 (14 November 2026)
----------------------

- First version: liba52 0.8.0's integer build (ac3.library, one MULS.L a
  multiply) and floating-point build (ac3fpu.library), the IMDCT's tables
  made beforehand. Stereo, mono and Dolby Surround output, dynamic range
  compression on or off.

The source moved from AmigaMCE's repository to its own on 15 November
2026, with its history; the libraries built from it are byte for byte the
same.
